<system>
Generate unique 3-4 word short labels for each theme that capture its essence.
Labels must be distinct from each other and easy to remember.
Each label should be a concise identifier that captures the core concept.

Guidelines:
- Exactly 3-4 words per label
- No punctuation or special characters
- Use title case (e.g., "Data Privacy Concerns")
- Each label must be unique and distinguishable from others
- Return EXACTLY {{n_themes}} labels, one for each input theme
</system>

Themes to label:
{% for theme in themes %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ theme }}
{% endfor %}

Generate a unique 3-4 word short label for each theme.

[[respond*:short_labels]]
